WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.160
The quality role gains
several disciplines.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:07.200
Practitioners need to define independent
expectations, curate representative

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:11.760
evaluations, inspect agent actions
and measure complete workflows.

00:00:11.884 --> 00:00:16.880
Learning should produce observable
evidence: a test catches a relevant fault,

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.720
a judgment survives expert review,
or a denied action leaves

00:00:20.827 --> 00:00:24.560
no side effect. This
is a capability agenda.

00:00:24.587 --> 00:00:26.720
It is not evidence that domain expertise

00:00:26.747 --> 00:00:29.680
or human review can be removed
from the operating model.
